#: ../../source/doc_changelog.rst:14
msgid ""
"Switched from using bootstap4 theme to furo sphinx theme. (Reason is that "
"the former isn't updated anymore. The later is updated, is used for the "
"python + pip doc and has built-in support for dark theme.)"
msgstr ""
"从 bootstrap4 主题切换到 furo sphinx 主题。（原因：前者已不再更新；后者仍在维护，被用于 Python 与 pip "
"文档，并内置深色主题支持。）"

#: ../../source/doc_changelog.rst:15
msgid "Use sphinx-design extension to simplify appearance of welcome page."
msgstr "使用 sphinx-design 扩展来简化欢迎页的外观。"

